    "Description": "A main rotor: lift with the up / down thrust (collective), the cyclic steers with your controls. Its torque turns the ship the other way: counter it with a reversible rotor mounted sideways away from the centre, or gyros. Its thrust is limited to what your ship can hold against that torque. Air only.",
